  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_AC_Repairman.png\" title=\"Ice Orok AC Repairman\"><img alt=\"Ice Orok AC Repairman\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"271\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_AC_Repairman.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_AC_Repairman.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Orok AC Repairman</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b> Orok\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Fighter\n</p><p>Dual Axe-Wielding Oroks that are smaller versions of the <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Chieftain\" title=\"Snow Chieftain\">Snow Chieftain</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Orok Chieftain\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Daze_Pustain's_Pad\" title=\"Daze Pustain's Pad\">Daze Pustain's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Ice Orok AC Repairman</b> are variety of Ice Orok Chieftains that are found in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>, Level 1.\n</li><li><b>Ice Orok AC Overseers</b> are larger versions of the Ice Orok AC Repairman found in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>, Level 1.\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
